{
  "comment": [
    "Fields of the compact match-stats frame (PKT_MATCH_STATS, format 1).",
    "The server (server/src/match_stats_frame.rs) and the client",
    "(client/src/net/matchStatsFrame.ts) both read this file, so they cannot",
    "disagree on the order. APPEND ONLY: a frame carries its field count and a",
    "reader decodes the prefix it knows, so a new field goes at the end and",
    "older clients simply stop before it. Reordering or retyping an entry",
    "needs a new format number.",
    "Each entry is [path, type]: path is the JSON path in the server's full",
    "/match-stats snapshot; type is f (f32), u (u32, saturating) b (bool, u8) or",
    "s (short string). The set is what the in-game stats overlay",
    "(client/src/city/CityStatsOverlay.tsx) and the tape analysis",
    "(scripts/perf/tape-analysis/analyse.py) read; everything else is served",
    "by GET /match-stats/:id."
  ],
  "format": 1,
  "fields": [
    [["server_build"], "s"],
    [["server_started"], "s"],
    [["physics_backend"], "s"],
    [["physics_gpu_active"], "b"],
    [["player_count"], "u"],
    [["physics_last_step_ms"], "f"],
    [["physics_gpu_wait_ms"], "f"],
    [["physics_active_dynamic_bodies"], "u"],
    [["physics_gpu_warning_count"], "u"],
    [["physics_gpu_rigid_contact_high_water"], "u"],
    [["timings", "total_ms", "avg"], "f"],
    [["timings", "total_ms", "p95"], "f"],
    [["timings", "total_ms", "max"], "f"],
    [["timings", "dynamics_ms", "avg"], "f"],
    [["timings", "city_total_ms", "avg"], "f"],
    [["spans", "destruction/native_bodies_outside_world", "v"], "f"],
    [["spans", "destruction/native_escaped_bodies", "v"], "f"],
    [["spans", "destruction/native_velocity_explosions", "v"], "f"],
    [["city", "structures"], "u"],
    [["city", "wire_version"], "u"],
    [["city", "chunk_bodies"], "u"],
    [["city", "awake_bodies"], "u"],
    [["city", "sleeping_bodies"], "u"],
    [["city", "frozen_bodies"], "u"],
    [["city", "broken_bonds"], "u"],
    [["city", "freeze_flips"], "u"],
    [["city", "unfreeze_flips"], "u"],
    [["city", "contact_wakes"], "u"],
    [["city", "frozen_serial_blocks"], "u"],
    [["city", "solver_island_count"], "u"],
    [["city", "quiet_slot_ticks"], "u"],
    [["city", "city_desync_repairs"], "u"],
    [["city", "gpu_stress_structures"], "u"],
    [["city", "unmapped_body_skips"], "u"],
    [["city", "duplicate_body_records"], "u"],
    [["city", "bytes_per_sec"], "u"],
    [["city", "degraded"], "b"],
    [["city", "step_ms"], "f"],
    [["city", "begin_ms"], "f"],
    [["city", "solve_ms"], "f"],
    [["city", "end_ms"], "f"],
    [["city", "ccd_ms"], "f"],
    [["city", "support_loads_ms"], "f"],
    [["city", "readback_ms"], "f"],
    [["city", "shape_readback_ms"], "f"],
    [["city", "events_ms"], "f"],
    [["city", "filters_ms"], "f"],
    [["city", "tick_ffi_ms"], "f"],
    [["city", "drain_ms"], "f"],
    [["city", "readback_ms_host"], "f"],
    [["city", "settle_ms"], "f"],
    [["city", "stats_ffi_ms"], "f"],
    [["city", "ingest_ms"], "f"],
    [["city", "fan_out_ms"], "f"],
    [["city", "publish_ms"], "f"],
    [["city", "encode_shared_ms"], "f"],
    [["city", "client_datagrams_ms"], "f"]
  ]
}
